# name  local_port  remote_host   remote_port
# Copy to config/tunnels.conf (gitignored). One forward per line, through
# the CML host on SSH 1122.
#
# cml is required. Every script that logs in to the controller, and the
# MCP server, dial CML_API_BASE from config/mcp-env/cml.env, which
# 20-up.sh writes as https://127.0.0.1:9443. Change the port here and
# there together, or nothing reaches the controller (ADR 0012).
cml 9443 127.0.0.1 443
# Cockpit is reachable directly, this is an example. The ISE and FTD spec
# adds their entries.
cockpit 9090 127.0.0.1 9090
# ise 8443 10.20.2.20 443     ISE GUI, then https://localhost:8443
# dc  3389 10.20.2.10 3389    domain controller RDP (docs/AD.md)
